      /* Color splits: caption in cyan/bluish, values default/bold etc. Plain capture unaffected. We'll draw whole with meter text color for prefix before ':'? Original text meters: label cyan, value bold white etc. Approx draw all in meter text then values bold? Keep simple: whole line default but first token cyan */
